WEBVTT

00:24:59.454 --> 00:25:02.204
Cathy knew she needed to be
wary of it at the outset.

00:25:02.329 --> 00:25:04.954
Is it truly as good of
an idea as it seems?

00:25:05.454 --> 00:25:09.038
It can take years to find out whether
a project has succeeded or failed.

00:25:09.871 --> 00:25:12.204
Luckily at Beristain, his colleagues
have discovered

00:25:12.204 --> 00:25:15.829
a workaround long before you know
the outcome of a decision.

00:25:16.121 --> 00:25:19.871
You can create metrics to evaluate the
quality of your decision process

00:25:20.038 --> 00:25:20.871
and process.

00:25:20.871 --> 00:25:25.038
Accountability is that you should
be accountable for making

00:25:25.038 --> 00:25:31.496
a reasonably good decision, not
in terms of how it turns out,